<h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-21_ pf-heading-1-h3">How Women Are Getting Their Libido Back After a Full Hysterectomy</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-23_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-839f8e57-5dcf-4d9c-8e92-9c56972ceeb1"><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><span style="background-color: rgba(189, 229, 33);"></span><span style="background-color: rgba(189, 229, 33);">If you've lost all desire after a full hysterectomy</span> and nothing your doctor has suggested has worked, read this first.</span></p><img alt="image2.jpg__PID:f88ea035-5000-4ba0-8e3a-c0ed8aa49c38" src="{{ 'image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image2_2e843d70-5511-4c34-8113-cdeaec5bf6b0.jpg?v=1771418052&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" loading="eager" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-26_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-27_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-28_"><img alt="588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg__PID:6c65bf96-2432-4350-a693-21231fc63711" src="{{ '588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/588385751_2354500468336936_132303201743788498_n.jpg?v=1775460234&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-29_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-30_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-31_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-70ffd380-e03d-4340-91ec-11a09c9b3b1a"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">By : Dr. Evelyn Hart Wellness, Women's Hormonal Health Specialist — Updated February 2026</span></p></div></div><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-34_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-f2847dd5-7e35-41a5-b21a-d84b8fc18703"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">You can't remember the last time you actually wanted to be touched.<br><br>Not last week. Not last month. Maybe not even last year.<br><br>Your husband reaches for you and your first thought is "not tonight."<br><br>You love him. You do. But something inside you just... isn't there anymore.<br><br>No spark. No interest. No drive.<br><br>Like that part of you was switched off and never came back on.<br><br>If you've had a full hysterectomy and you're nodding right now, what I'm about to share might change everything you thought you knew about why your libido disappeared.<br><br>Because it's not your age.<br><br>It's not your marriage.<br><br>And it's not in your head.<br><br>It's something that happened during surgery that nobody explained to you.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-37_ pf-heading-1-h3">"I Used to Be the One Who Initiated"</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-39_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5c8c61e7-7ff9-4b33-a2b3-fb1d0ae9ecb7"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">That's what a 52-year-old patient told me last year.<br><br>Full hysterectomy at 45. Uterus and both ovaries removed. Instant menopause. Seven years ago.<br><br>Before surgery, she was the one with the drive. The spark. The energy.<br><br>She didn't think about desire the way she thinks about it now.<br><br>It was just there. Like breathing.<br><br>Her husband never had to wonder if she wanted him. She showed him. Every week. Sometimes twice.<br><br>The surgery was supposed to fix the fibroids and the heavy bleeding.<br><br>And it did.<br><br>But nobody mentioned the part where she'd stop feeling anything else too.</span></p><img alt="image5.jpg__PID:a9131eec-5f4c-4742-bf28-1d4f6a455cb2" src="{{ 'image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image5_559a8b39-80a8-486b-9268-f8aa6a12e7be.jpg?v=1771418083&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-42_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-43_ pf-heading-1-h3">It Doesn't Happen Overnight. It's Worse Than That…</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-45_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-c9162922-7404-4c73-9024-ea9e9ffd1deb"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">It never happens in one moment. It's a fade so slow you almost don't notice.<br><br>Month one after surgery. She's recovering. Of course she doesn't feel anything. That's normal.<br><br>Month three. Still nothing. But she's healing. Give it time.<br><br>Month six. Still nothing.<br><br>Not low desire.<br><br>Not "I'm not in the mood tonight."<br><br>ZERO.<br><br>Like the part of her brain that used to notice her husband walked out of the surgery room and never came back.<br><br>She starts to realize something is wrong.<br><br>Her husband reaches for her at night. She feels his hand on her hip.<br><br>And instead of warmth, she feels dread.<br><br>Not because she doesn't love him.<br><br>Because she knows what comes next.<br><br>The guilt. The excuse. The quiet rejection she has to deliver for the hundredth time.<br><br>She used to pull him closer.<br><br>Now she's calculating how to pull away without breaking his heart.<br><br>And the worst part?<br><br>She can see what it's doing to him. Every night.<br><br>That look in his eyes he tries to hide.<br><br>Not anger. Something worse.<br><br>Confusion. Like he's losing her and doesn't understand why.<br></span></p><img alt="image10.jpg__PID:bcd27db2-fcb4-4b29-aad7-dafad47d99dc" src="{{ 'image10.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image10.jpg?v=1771418106&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-48_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-49_ pf-heading-1-h3">Then Comes the Conversation That Changes Everything</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-51_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-6bf542c5-2298-49a3-b9b2-8f2a2f343db1"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Every post-hysterectomy woman I work with describes the same moment.<br><br>Sitting across from her partner. Heart pounding.<br><br>Trying to explain something she doesn't understand herself.<br><br>"It's not you. I don't know what's wrong with me.<br><br>"He nods. Says he understands.<br><br>But she can see it.<br><br>The hurt he's trying to swallow.<br><br>That look on his face like the ground just shifted under him.<br><br>He wants to fix it. He can't.<br><br>She wants to want him. She can't.<br><br>And they sit there. Two people who love each other. Separated by something neither of them can see or name or solve.<br><br>One woman told me: "That conversation was harder than the surgery.<br><br>"I believe her.<br><br>Because the surgery took something from her body.<br><br>That conversation took something from her marriage.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-54_ pf-heading-1-h3">Here's What Happens If You Do Nothing...</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-56_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-33cfdd03-b6f4-49a0-bcc8-55249741f866"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Loss of libido after a full hysterectomy doesn't just stay the same.<br><br>It destroys marriages.<br><br><strong>Year one: </strong>You both assume it'll come back. He's patient. You're hopeful.<br><br><strong>Year two:</strong> He stops reaching for you. The rejection has worn him down. You start feeling relieved when he doesn't try. And that relief is the most dangerous sign of all.<br><br><strong>Year three: </strong>You're roommates. You eat together. Watch TV together. Split the bills. But the intimacy is gone. He stares at the TV but he's not really watching. He's quieter. More distant.<br><br><strong>Year four:</strong> He asks for a divorce. Not because he stopped loving you. Because he couldn't keep living without intimacy.<br><br>Or he doesn't say anything at all. He just... leaves.<br><br>Marriages where physical intimacy stops for more than two years are significantly more likely to end in divorce.<br><br>Every month this goes unaddressed is another month of damage to your marriage.<br><br>And it doesn't have to be this way.</span></p><img alt="image6.jpg__PID:345cc8ed-f806-4cda-a571-4c5b31651fac" src="{{ 'image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image6_bbfa503f-4e46-4d8e-a191-079ae9b33620.jpg?v=1771418125&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-59_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-60_ pf-heading-1-h3">Why Your Doctor's Advice Is Making This Worse</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-62_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-12c3eb23-fbcc-4211-8730-b6e478a65f1e"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">When she finally brings this up with her doctor, she gets one of four responses.<br><br>None of them work.<br><br><strong>"Give it time."</strong><br><br>It's been five years. Time has given her nothing.<br><br><strong>"Let's adjust your HRT."</strong><br><br>HRT manages hot flashes. It was never designed to restore desire.<br><br>That's like putting a bandage on a broken bone.<br><br><strong>"That's normal at your age."</strong><br><br>As if turning 50 means you're supposed to stop wanting your husband.<br><br><strong>"Have you considered therapy?"</strong><br><br>You can't talk your way into a hormonal response your body can't produce.<br><br>That's like sending someone to therapy for a broken leg.<br><br>These women aren't broken. They're not imagining it.<br><br>Something specific happened to their bodies.<br><br>And almost nobody is explaining what it actually is.</span></p><img alt="image12.jpg__PID:8350e0ff-6f33-4255-a52d-b67512145b27" src="{{ 'image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image12_baa9b70b-cbfc-4b3d-a461-a0b76156f9f3.jpg?v=1771418143&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-65_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-66_ pf-heading-1-h3">The Real Reason Nothing Has Worked</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-68_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-9f530dd9-36bb-471c-aa3d-91e8810a377b"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Over 600,000 women have a hysterectomy every year. One-third are full hysterectomies.<br><br>Every single one is thrown into instant surgical menopause.<br><br>Not gradual. Overnight. Like falling off a cliff instead of walking down a hill.<br><br>Remember the electrical system?<br><br><strong>Three things collapse at once:</strong><br><br><strong>The power source is gone.</strong> No ovaries means no raw materials. Energy, mood, sleep, desire. All running on empty.<br><br><strong>The wiring is broken. </strong>HRT replaces estrogen. That's one wire. Desire needs all of them. Surgical menopause cuts every wire. HRT patches one.<br><br><strong>The signal can't get through. </strong>Her brain knows she loves her husband. But the physical signal that turns knowing into wanting requires hormonal infrastructure she no longer has.<br><br>This is why HRT helps hot flashes but not desire.<br><br>This is why testosterone doesn't work. Doctors borrowed a male solution for a female problem.<br><br>This is why therapy can't fix this. You can't talk your way into a physical response.<br><br>Every failed solution was either forcing the switch with no power behind it. Or patching one wire while the rest of the house stayed dark.</span></p><img alt="image9.jpg__PID:b1147bf9-2041-4e70-9cb3-b701ead72836" src="{{ 'image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image9_3789bf0f-1069-4fa9-8667-5f128ac3048e.jpg?v=1771418163&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-71_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-72_ pf-heading-1-h3">And Then Something Remarkable Caught My Attention...</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-74_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-478f6d50-5f31-4995-b60c-61559058b55e"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">The supplement industry has been trying to solve female desire the same way for years.<br><br>Force it. Libido pills. "Female Viagra." Stimulants.<br><br>That's like pressing the gas pedal with the emergency brake on.<br><br>A fundamentally different approach has emerged:<br><br><strong>You don't force the switch. You restore the power.</strong><br><br>A product called ShilaSource is gaining attention in the post-hysterectomy community.<br><br>Not from marketing. From women telling other women.<br><br>It addresses the three layers of damage that surgical menopause creates:<br><br><strong>Single ingredient. No additives. No fillers.</strong> Authentic Himalayan shilajit resin (300mg per dose) — sourced from <strong>16,000+ feet</strong> in the Himalayas, delivering <strong>75% Fulvic acid</strong> + <strong>85+ trace minerals</strong> at <strong>98% purity</strong> (Eurofins lab-verified, COA available with every batch). <strong>One rice-grain dose under the tongue.</strong> One per day. Not a pill. Not a prescription. Absorbs through saliva in 10 seconds — no chewing, no swallowing.</span></p><img alt="image3.png__PID:c582512b-d1b8-441d-8cc9-8b4fbf3744d9" src="https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766" srcset="https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=375 375w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=550 550w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=768 768w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://wellnessnest.co/cdn/shop/files/EBEFE9.webp?v=10823860688489950766&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-77_ pf-image