1a9d1456"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Karen T.</span></p></div></div><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE rid-49 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-a9448ba6-dce9-4080-981a-9d145659ada8"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">"Both ovaries removed at 49. Zero desire for almost a decade. Around week 4, the blankness started lifting. My husband noticed before I even said anything."</span></p></div></div></div><div class="pf-slide"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-dNsUpz kRImrw rid-27"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ rid-28"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ rid-30"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ rid-31"><img alt="Screenshot_818.png__PID:0ac8ff77-333a-402d-b46f-f68b291bb380" src="{{ 'Screenshot_818.png' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/Screenshot_818.png?v=1771418627&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.19827