28.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z"></path></svg></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ rid-45"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU rid-46 pf-icon2-1"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z"></path></svg></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ rid-47"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU rid-48 pf-icon2-1"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z"></path></svg></div></div><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE rid-34 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5a3ec16a-55e4-4c18-a8b5-54ed2a38b811"><span class="pf-paragraph-content "> Susan W.</span></p></div></div><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE rid-49 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-6a55e4dc-1828-4554-ad2a-38b811c338f8"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">"We spent thousands on therapy after my hysterectomy. Nothing changed because the problem was hormonal. Three months on ShilaSource and my husband says he has his wife back. I say I have myself back."</span></p></div></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Previous" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-prev none"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Next" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-next none"></button><div class="pf-slider-nav pagination-style-2"></div></div></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-214_ pf-heading-1-h3">Picture This...</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-216_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-0a2acad4-df34-4587-8d64-e056d3b77ba4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Imagine him reaching for your hand. And you not pulling away.<br><br>Not out of guilt. Not out of duty. Because you actually want to be close to him.<br><br>Imagine leaning into him on the couch and realizing you did it without thinking.<br><br>Like your body remembered something your mind had given up on.<br><br>Imagine looking at your husband the way you used to. Before the surgery. Before the silence.<br><br>That's what women are describing. Not a miracle. A slow, steady return of something they were told they'd never get back.</span></p><a href="https://wellnessnest.co/pages/shilasource-himalayan-shilajit-resin-wm-en" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-fbFjKN hkmIsP pf-219_ pf-button-1 cta-btn-shila">Check Availability<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU pf-220_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg></a><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-221_ pf-heading-1-h3">Here's What Makes Me Angry About All of This</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-223_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-95870d64-e056-43b7-bba4-07af03523a3d"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">I've worked in women's health for 18 years.<br><br>And I still cannot understand why surgeons have a detailed plan for what to remove.<br><br>And no plan for what to restore.<br><br>Nobody tells these women:<br><br>"After a full hysterectomy, your body will go into instant menopause, your hormonal system will crash, and your libido may disappear completely. Here's what you can do about it.<br><br>"Nobody says:<br><br>"HRT alone won't fix this. It patches one piece. You need to replenish, rebalance, and restore the full system."<br><br>They find out from each other.<br><br>From a friend who went through the same thing. From a woman at their support group. From an article like this one.<br><br>That's not acceptable.<br><br>Not for 600,000 women a year.<br><br>Not for their husbands.<br><br>Not for the marriages that are quietly falling apart while doctors shrug and say "that's normal at your age."</span></p><img alt="image4.jpg__PID:93db5e12-aadb-4baf-ab44-9f48b6473e12" src="{{ 'image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image4_af9d47be-34ec-48f7-9847-27e6e10e714c.jpg?v=1771418194&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-226_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-227_ pf-heading-1-h3">Who This Is For (And Who It's Not For)</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-229_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-d3b77ba4-07af-4352-ba3d-c9d4538c2ba6"><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>ShilaSource may be worth trying if:</strong><br><br>You've had a full hysterectomy and your libido disappeared afterward.<br><br>You've been told "give it time" and time has given you nothing.<br><br>HRT helped with hot flashes but not with wanting.<br><br>You've tried supplements, therapy, or prescription libido medications and nothing touched the core problem.<br><br>You feel guilty every time your partner reaches for you and you feel nothing.<br><br>You're starting to believe this is permanent.<br><br><strong>This is probably not for you if:</strong><br><br>Your libido issues are primarily related to relationship problems, not hormonal depletion.<br><br>You haven't given your body adequate recovery time post-surgery (less than 6 months).<br><br>You're looking for an instant fix. This works gradually over 3-6 weeks.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-232_ pf-heading-1-h3">Try It Completely Risk-Free</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-234_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-03523a3d-c9d4-438c-aba6-9eb6e2100787"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Think about what you've already spent trying to fix this.<br><br>HRT adjustments and doctor visits. $200-$500 per appointment.<br><br>Testosterone prescriptions. $100-$300 per month.<br><br>Therapy sessions. $150-$250 each.<br><br>Libido supplements that didn't work. $40-$80 a bottle.<br><br>Most women I work with have spent $2,000 to $5,000 over the years.<br><br>On solutions that patched one wire while the rest of the house stayed dark.<br><br>ShilaSource costs a fraction of that.<br><br>One shilajit resin per day. No prescription. No doctor visits. No side effects reported.<br><br>And it comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee.<br><br>If nothing changes in 90 days, you send it back.<br><br>Full refund. No questions asked.<br><br>You've already spent years and thousands of dollars on things that didn't work.<br><br>A risk-free trial of something that actually addresses all three layers of what surgical menopause destroyed?<br><br>That's the least you owe yourself.</span></p><img alt="image7.jpg__PID:c3a4ad09-d63a-4872-92cd-19ff59f7583b" src="{{ 'image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/8075/4222/files/image7_29ef491c-55e5-4f84-b99f-25c54f3cec5b.jpg?v=1771418215&amp;width=2048 2048w" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.3389149363697255" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-jwZJYP clbmpw pf-237_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"><a href="https://wellnessnest.co/pages/shilasource-himalayan-shilajit-resin-wm-en" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-fbFjKN hkmIsP pf-238_ pf-button-1 cta-btn-shila">Check Availability<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU pf-239_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg></a><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-240_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-9bcab755-5957-4a07-8f16-9422e9640ceb"><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Note: </strong>Due to increased demand from the post-hysterectomy community, ShilaSource periodically experiences stock shortages. If the product is currently available, it's recommended to secure your order.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-243_ pf-heading-1-h3">One Last Thing Before You Go...</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-245_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-26d62d4b-a754-421a-8708-0b3e3f03772a"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">I want to leave you with this.<br><br>This isn't just about libido. It isn't just about sex.<br><br>This is about your marriage.<br><br>The man who stood next to you before surgery and promised to be there.<br><br>He's still there.<br><br>But he's watching you disappear behind a wall neither of you built.<br><br>And he doesn't know how to reach you anymore.<br><br>This is about your confidence.<br><br>The woman you were before someone removed your organs and forgot to tell you what it would cost you.<br><br>She's still in there.<br><br>Standing in a dark house with no power, flipping a switch that doesn't work, wondering what went wrong.<br><br>This is about the years you have left.<br><br>Not just to exist. But to feel. To want. To reach for the person you chose to spend your life with and mean it.<br><br>Every month you wait is another month of distance.<br><br>Another month of guilt.<br><br>Another month of lying next to someone you love and feeling nothing.<br><br>You didn't choose this.<br><br>The surgery was necessary.<br><br>But accepting the aftermath as permanent?<br><br>That IS a choice.<br><br>And now you have a different one.</span></p><a href="https://wellnessnest.co/pages/shilasource-himalayan-shilajit-resin-wm-en" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-fbFjKN hkmIsP pf-248_ pf-button-1 cta-btn-shila">Check Availability<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU pf-249_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg></a></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-250_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-251_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-252_ pf-heading-1-h3">Sleep Away Knee Pains</h3><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ 